Subject: [PATCH 4/6] feat(marketplace): listings CRUD + AI recommendations
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

POST/PATCH /api/marketplace/listings — same validation as before, minus
the seller-verification check (there's no Stripe account to verify in
this version). RLS still enforces parent/teacher-only + own-row-only.

POST /api/marketplace/recommend — unchanged in spirit from the earlier
design: grounds Gemini's picks against a real candidate list of active
listings and filters the response against that same set before
returning it. Read-only, never implies a purchase or reservation.
